.cljc`](file:///Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/src/cljc/yin/vm/module.cljc#L92)) are bit-identical across CLJS, Wasmtime, and Wasmer.\n2. **Unambiguous \u0026 Interning-Invariant ABI Wire Codec (§4.1.1)**: Outer-only `u8 tag | u32 payload-byte-length (LE) | payload` framing, map/set sorting by recursively expanded canonical value bytes independent of `tag 13` arena references, canonical quiet NaN (`00 00 00 00 00 00 f8 7f` LE), and CLJS [`dao.jing.cbor/float64?`](file:///Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/src/cljc/dao/jing/cbor.cljc#L472-L480) carrier + `-0.0` preservation ([`integer-host/exact-integer?`](file:///Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/src/cljc/yin/vm/integer/host.cljc#L51-L66)) eliminate cross-host encoding drift.\n3. **Code-Verified \u0026 Properly Phased Shared Traversal Order (§4.1.2)**: All unordered map/set traversal sites that mint IDs or choose diagnostics in [engine.cljc](file:///Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/src/cljc/yin/vm/engine.cljc#L847-L1124) (`encoder`, `encode-store`, `markers`, `lower-resources`, `receive-module`, [`resume-from-run-queue`](file:///Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/src/cljc/yin/vm/engine.cljc#L2295-L2315)) and [module.cljc](file:///Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/src/cljc/yin/vm/module.cljc#L100-L169) (`module-entries`, `list-modules`) are accurately identified, existing explicit sorts ([`engine.cljc`](file:///Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/src/cljc/yin/vm/engine.cljc#L1009-L1106)) are preserved, the boundary between current kernel behavior and the planned shared prerequisite is explicit, and slice gates in W0, W3, and W4 are properly sequenced around it.\n4. **Complete Slice Gates \u0026 Preserved R2/R3 Architecture (§1–§7)**: Transport status and `NEED_SPACE` / `fetch-response` once-only retry conformance are gated in W0 and W3, Wasmer W1–W4 full-trace execution and bidirectional native↔CLJS module-slice parity are gated in W4, and all 23 opcode lowerings, map↔memory synchronization, continuation capture/restore, custody gates, FFI two-step, and core-wasm-1.0 portability invariants remain intact.\n","duration_seconds":3368.030767,"num_turns":5,"usage":{"input_tokens":1213580,"output_tokens":107873,"thinking_tokens":49790,"cache_read_tokens":5583330,"total_tokens":1321453}}
